        "contenuto_esteso": "Nobel Prize-winning economist Paul Krugman on Thursday slammed National Economic Council Director Kevin Hassett's statement that President Trump’s policies will create a golden age and cause the economy to grow by 4 percent to 5 percent this year. Hassett, Trump’s top economic adviser, made the statement on Thursday during an interview on Fox Business's \"Mornings..."
